WEBVTT

00:16:29.836 --> 00:16:32.196
from the Everly Brothers

00:16:33.076 --> 00:16:35.196
and then the Beatles,

00:16:35.236 --> 00:16:38.756
Elton John and many more,

00:16:39.676 --> 00:16:45.956
songs that sometimes would surprise me
with a stab of ending,

00:16:45.956 --> 00:16:49.356
quickly washed away by their sheer beauty

00:16:49.396 --> 00:16:51.676
and the inspiration that they gave me.

00:16:52.756 --> 00:16:54.956
I know what they mean

00:16:54.996 --> 00:16:56.636
and what they meant to me.

00:16:57.876 --> 00:17:02.396
I've often wondered:
What would we be without music?